  (text "USB-C or 9-24V DC creates 5V_SYS, 3V3 and SW_CORE.\\nSW_CORE is intentionally gated: switch power/reset remains safe when MCU watchdog fails.\\nExternal DC presence feeds health status before root-resistant active can be shown." (at 20.32 22.86 0)
